{
 "id": "a8312e9d-f78a-4e7a-8c42-0508b2fe571a",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "#Sono Gap ni Yowai Tokushuu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "#そのギャップにょゎぃ 特集"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "#Sono Gap Nyoi Tokushuu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"If I knew about this gap of yours, I'd fall in love!\"\n\nThe side your partner only shows you is irresistible! There's plenty of addictive gap moe in these stories! A collection of one shots featuring \"gap boys.\"\n\nCover Illustration: Machi Suehiro\n\nList of stories:\n1. The Chief Iwatsuji Only I Know / **Ore dake Shitteru Iwatsuji Kachou** (俺だけ知ってる岩辻課長) by ***Utsumi Long***\n\n2. Cute Liar / **Kawaii Usotsuki** (かわいいうそつき) by ***Suehiro Machi***\n\n3. **NON STOP Zaizen-kun** (NON STOP財前くん) by ***Kusege***\n\n4. The Right Way to Shorten Our Distance / **Tadashii Kyori no Chizume Kata** (正しい距離の縮め方) by ***JANMN***\n\n5. Akaoni-kun's Rice Ball / **Akaoni-kun no Onigiri** (赤鬼くんのおにぎり) by ***Hakata***\n\n6. It's Your Fault for Being So Suggestive / **Omowaseburi na Kimi ga Warui** (思わせぶりな君がわるい) by ***Tamaki Tsumugu***\n\n7. About a Guy Called \"Matsubara\" / **\"Matsubara\" to Iu Otoko** (「松原」という男) by ***Hashioka Ritsuki***\n\n8. Tell Me About Your Fingers / **Yubisaki de Oshiete** (指先でおしえて) by ***Yamamoto Mato***\n\n9. My Roommate's an Android? / **Roommate wa Android?** (ルームメイトはアンドロイド？) by ***Yamaguchi Suguri***\n\n10. Do You Understand What You're Doing, Senpai? / **Senpai, Wakatte Yatten no?** (先輩、わかってやってんの？) by ***Rakuta Shouko***",
   "ja": "＼君のそんなギャップ知ったら好きになっちゃうだろ！／\n\n🌟pixivコミックだけでお届けするショート特集🌟\n完全新作読み切り集「ギャップ男子」が大集合！\n\n相手にしか見せないその姿がたまらない、\nやみつきになるギャップが盛りだくさん！\n複数の作家陣が「ギャップ男子」をテーマに執筆！"
  },
